cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  To cite the mathematics, cite the paper (preferred citation below). To cite
  the formalization itself, cite this repository.
title: "Condensation in subcritical Cauchy Bienaymé trees: Lean formalization"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Kortchemski
    given-names: Igor
repository-code: https://github.com/igor-kortchemski/condensation-subcritical-cauchy-bienayme-trees
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - Lean 4
  - Mathlib
  - formalization
  - Bienaymé trees
  - condensation
  - Cauchy domain of attraction
abstract: >-
  Lean 4 and Mathlib formalization of every result of "Condensation in
  subcritical Cauchy Bienaymé trees" by Igor Kortchemski and Leonard Vetter,
  four of them in corrected form, using only the axioms propext,
  Classical.choice and Quot.sound. Produced with AI agents; the Lean kernel
  checks the proofs.
preferred-citation:
  type: article
  title: Condensation in subcritical Cauchy Bienaymé trees
  authors:
